  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 15 is Apex Nature's longest at 316 feet — a par 4 that brings the creek into play and gives the round its one true decision hole. A drive down the hardwood corridor, then an approach that has to respect the water. It's the hole that makes this friendly park course feel like a real course.",
  "localTips": "Three tee sets — red is the friendly loop, blue adds distance. The creek is in play on the back nine, especially after rain. Free to play in a beautiful nature park; bring a putter and a midrange and enjoy the walk.",
